  /* ═══ §54: below the breakpoint every row becomes a RECORD ═══
     Nine columns in a 360px viewport are unreadable however far they slide, so
     this is not a horizontal scroll. Each row becomes a card, each cell prints
     its column name above its value, and everything past the record's title
     folds away behind one button.

